OL,3,APoundland collapses putting 11,000 jobs
OL,4,Aat risk                                
OL,6,FPoundland boss Barry Williams said in a
OL,7,Fnote to staff that the board had "no   
OL,8,Falternative but to take this decision",
OL,9,Fbut was making it with "sincere sadness
OL,10,Fand intense regret".                   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
