OL,3,AGordon Ramsay to host Top Gear as show 
OL,4,Arevived after Flintoff crash           
OL,6,FTV chef Gordon Ramsay is to lead the   
OL,7,Fnew presenting line-up on BBC motoring 
OL,8,Fshow Top Gear, which is being revived  
OL,9,Ffour years after it was last on air.   
OL,11,FRamsay will take the driving seat      
OL,12,Falongside as yet unnamed co-presenters 
OL,13,Fwhen the show starts filming next year.
OL,14,FIt will return to screens in 2028.     
OL,16,FThe long-running programme has been off
OL,17,Fair since 2022, when co-host Andrew    
OL,18,FFlintoff suffered serious facial and   
OL,19,Frib injuries after his open-topped     
OL,20,Fthree-wheeled car overturned at the    
OL,21,Fshow's test-track.                     
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
