OL,3,AImages of asteroid targeted to test    
OL,4,AEarth's defences reveal stadium-sized  
OL,5,Acrater                                 
OL,7,FThe first images of an asteroid that   
OL,8,FNasa deliberately crashed into have    
OL,9,Frevealed a stadium-sized crater on its 
OL,10,Fsurface.                               
OL,12,FThe extensive damage was caused when a 
OL,13,FNasa spacecraft hit the asteroid       
OL,14,FDimorphos in 2022. The asteroid posed  
OL,15,Fno threat, but this was a test of our  
OL,16,Fplanetary defences to see if it was    
OL,17,Fpossible to knock a space rock off     
OL,18,Fcourse.                                
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
