OL,3,AThirty-one killed in massive fire as   
OL,4,Afuel tanker crashes on Cairo highway   
OL,6,FThirty-one people have been killed and 
OL,7,F21 others injured in a large fire on a 
OL,8,Fbusy highway in Cairo after a fuel     
OL,9,Ftanker crashed, Egypt's health ministry
OL,10,Fsays.                                  
OL,12,FHospitals nearby treated patients      
OL,13,Fsuffering burns and smoke inhalation   
OL,14,Fafter the incident, which occurred on a
OL,15,Fsection of a ring road in the Warraq   
OL,16,Fneighbourhood, to the north of the old 
OL,17,Fcity centre, on Wednesday evening.     
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
