OL,3,AThirty-one killed in massive fire as   
OL,4,Afuel tanker crashes on Cairo highway   
OL,6,FUnverified footage circulating on      
OL,7,Fsocial media showed billowing flames   
OL,8,Fand black smoke towering high into the 
OL,9,Fnight sky, with multiple nearby        
OL,10,Fvehicles torched.                      
OL,12,FOfficials have not given an account of 
OL,13,Fhow the fire broke out, but state-owned
OL,14,Fmedia reported the tanker had          
OL,15,Foverturned, dousing nearby vehicles    
OL,16,Fwith petrol.                           
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
