OL,3,AIsraeli judges recommend dropping most 
OL,4,Aserious charges against Netanyahu      
OL,6,FJudges in Israel have suggested        
OL,7,Fprosecutors drop bribery charges       
OL,8,Fagainst Benjamin Netanyahu, potentially
OL,9,Fhanding the caretaker prime minister a 
OL,10,Fboost as he fights for his political   
OL,11,Fsurvival.                              
OL,13,FThe judges told the attorney general   
OL,14,Fthat there was little chance of        
OL,15,Fconviction in the first of three cases 
OL,16,Fhe is facing, in which he is accused of
OL,17,Fgranting government favours in exchange
OL,18,Ffor positive media coverage.           
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
